frequencies of TDP-43-immunoreactivity and each of the
6 TDP-43 stages by age at death were estimated using logistic
regression with age modelled using a restricted cubic spline.
Models were ﬁt for all cases including a subset of 581 cases
with antemortem diagnosis of dementia.
