function mutations in three CCM genes, KRIT1, CCM2,a n d
PDCD10. To date, various variants of the CCM gene have
been reported. However, the reports of the Korean cases were
sparse. Therefore, we would like to research the patients of sus-
picious familial CCMs with gene tests in our center.
