pacitated patients with severe stroke and their surrogate
decision-makers were enrolled at 3 Johns Hopkins-af ﬁliated
hospitals. Severe stroke was deﬁned as 1) AIS with NIH Stroke
Scale (NIHSS) ≥15 on admission without reperfusion therapy
or at 24 hours after reperfusion therapy; and 2) ICH with
