ence between estimated and observed 3-month mRS was
2 (IQR 0-2; p=0.002); 66.7% of surrogates estimated the
mRS ≥1 level lower than observed; 52.4% of surrogates esti-
mated patient outcomes ≥2 mRS levels lower than observed
