Brain MRI showed acute infarct involving the left parietal
operculum, and posterior left parietal lobe, subacute infarct
in the right posterior frontal centrum semiovale, in addition
to multiple small old infarcts. MR angiogram of the head
was normal. The patient did not receive tPA as he was on
apixaban, nor thrombectomy since there was no large vessel
