medical decision-making. However, seeking expert knowledge
is often dif ﬁcult and there are few available platforms to facili-
tate such conversations. TheMednet is an online platform that
allows for the dissemination of expert knowledge and opinions
in a searchable, private, and moderated question and answer
format. Originally established in oncology in 2014 and now
including over 12,000 US oncologists, we sought to establish
the feasibility of this platform among neurologists.
