an ‘Ask Question ’ button and then reviewed and revised by a
team of physician editors. Approved questions were then sent
to appropriate content experts in neurology. Expert responses
were reviewed for accuracy. Neurologist engagement was
measured in user registrations, Q&A views, and posted ques-
