1.5 hours, requiring repeated administration. Encapsulation of
LD-CD into nanoparticles (NPs) may prevent LD metabolism
in the gut and increase its stability.
Objective: The objectives of this study are to synthesize
biocompatible and biodegradable LD-CD-loaded lipid NPs
and poly(lactide-co-glycolide) (PLGA) NPs, and to measure
NP characteristics and stability, with a goal of reducing LD
decarboxylation in the gut and enhancing LD bioavailability
to boost LD brain delivery.
