Dystonia Parkinsonism
Federico Parisi, PhD
1, David Balkwill, MSc 2, Patrick Acuña,
MD, MPH3, Criscely Go, MD 4, Nutan Sharma, MD, PhD 3,
Paolo Bonato, PhD 1, Christopher D. Stephen, MB ChB,
MRCP (UK), MS 3. 1Motion Analysis Laboratory, Spaulding
Rehabilitation Hospital and Harvard Medical School, Boston,
