tory canals revealed punctate areas of enhancement at the
fundus of her bilateral auditory canals. She was initially diag-
nosed with bilateral ear infections and benign paroxysmal
positional vertigo. Her MRI brain obtained 8 months after
symptom onset showed T2 hyperintense lesions in the infe-
