UCLA and replicated independently at contract research
organizations (CROs).
Results: Both prophylactic and therapeutic TRE-515
treatments of EAE mice signi ﬁcantly improved clinical scores
at peak disease compared to vehicle-treated EAE mice
(Prophylactic: 1.8 /C61.3 versus 3.3 /C60.5 p<0.005; Therapeu-
