leukocyte CNS in ﬁltration. The effects of TRE-515 in this
model are similar or superior to published preclinical results
with approved MS therapies tested in the same model. Inde-
pendent CROs validated both results (Prophylactic: 2.2 /C61.4
versus 3.1 /C60.5 p<0.05; Therapeutic: 1.0 /C60.8 versus
