M243. Multifaceted Outcome Bene ﬁt of Glibenclamide
After Murine Traumatic Brain Injury Across Sex
Anupama Rani, Ph.D.
1, Sudhanshu Raikwar, DVM, MVSc,
Ph.D.1, Shaun Carlson, Ph.D. 2, Joshua Catapano, MD 1,
Sandra Mihaljevic, Ph.D. 1, Katherine Karahalios, MS 1, Jarrod
