single nucleotide polymorphism rs670 correlate with rates of
PD progression. Intrigued by this observation we examined
human plasma samples and noted that ApoA1 co-
immunoprecipitated with aSyn in both control and PD
patients. Fibrillization assays in cell-free systems revealed that
ApoA1 inhibited formation of human ﬁbrillar aSyn detect-
