accurately detects misfolded α-Synuclein aggregates ( αSyn
seeds) in CSF of patients with Parkinson ’s disease (PD),
dementia with Lewy bodies (DLB), and multiple system atro-
phy (MSA)( 1-3). Less is known about αSyn seeds in patho-
logically de ﬁned stages of Lewy-related pathology (LRP) and
the inﬂuence of AD neuropathological change (ADNC).
