polyneuropathies provides convincing evidence that CSF
NFL is a biomarker re ﬂecting peripheral nerve injury. Fur-
ther, the temporal associations seen in other neuropathies
suggest that it may be a useful surrogate marker of clinical
change, including improvement in sensory polyneuropathy,
in clinical trials of neuroprotective strategies.
