The median age at presentation of the LI-MLD cohort was
1.5 years (25th-75th %ile: 1.1-1.8). Within the LI-MLD
cohort, 82 (38%) had developmental delay (or stagnation)
prior to MLD onset. Among the LI-MLD cohort with a
