endosomes, which may impair transport of nuclear-encoded
mitochondrial proteins to axonal protein. Therefore, our data
supports disrupted transport of nuclear-encoded mitochondrial
proteins as a novel mechanism for mitochondrial dysfunction
in a human model of TBCK-de ﬁciency.
