intrathecal antibodies directed against enteroviruses were
detected using a peptide microarray. Autoantibody discovery
led in one patient with ataxia to identi ﬁcation of a novel can-
didate autoantigen. In addition, a subgroup of patients (n=5)
with Fanconi-Anemia-associated-Neurological-Syndrome
were evaluated, with ﬁndings leading to the hypothesis that
this is caused by innate-immune system and microglial activa-
tion leading to an obliterative vasculopathy, while ruling out
