in perivascular foci. Given these results, patient was placed on
IV methylprednisolone and subsequently saw improvement in
symptoms and diminished ﬁndings on repeat MRI.
Discussion: CLIPPERS syndrome is a rare, recently dis-
covered condition with a diagnosis mostly dependent upon
characteristic MRI ﬁndings, exclusion of alternative diagno-
