second variant creates a premature translational stop signal in
exon 146 of the titin mRNA. MRI of the right thigh with and
without contrast showed signi ﬁcant fatty atrophy with mildly
increased signal and mild enhancement in the quadriceps,
biceps femoris long head, semitendinosus, and semi-
