of childhood, has a cold tumor immune microenvironment
demonstrated by a lack of lymphocytic in ﬁltration and low
tumoral PD-L1 expression. We and others have shown that
this tumor is highly in ﬁltrated with IBA-1 and HLA-DR posi-
