the tumor and reveal multiple potential mechanisms of immu-
nosuppression. In addition to enriched PD-L1 expression, we
ﬁnd CTLA-4, TIM-3, and VISTA among others. Principal
component analysis reveals a separation between IBA-1+ cells
inﬁltrating SHH versus non-WNT/non-SHH molecular sub-
