the biology of these tumors. In line with other studies, we ﬁnd
the immune checkpoint molecule B7-H3 to be enriched in
tumor cells rather than IBA-1+ cells. Our syngeneic murine
medulloblastoma cell line, mCB DNp53 MYC, also demon-
strates tumoral expression of B7-H3 in vitro and in vivo. Simi-
lar to human tumors, this model has a paucity of in ﬁltrating
lymphocytes and increased in ﬁltration of microglia/macro-
